<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to the announcement by Dwellop AS (the "Company") on 30 December 2022 regarding the share capital increase resolved by the Company's board of directors, based on the authorisation granted by the general meeting on 16 June 2021. <br>The share capital increase pertaining to the issuance of new shares has been registered with the Norwegian Register of Business Enterprises: <br>Share capital: 7,309,359.95<br>Total number of shares: 295,467<br>Par value of each share: 24.7383293 (rounded)<br><br>* * *<br><br>For further information, please contact:<br>Helge Hustoft, Chief Executive Officer<br>Phone: +47 51 57 29 12<br>Mobile: +47 91 57 58 76<br>E-mail: helge.hustoft@dwellop.no<br>This information is published in accordance with the disclosure requirements set out in the Continuing Obligations for companies with shares registered on the NOTC-List.</p></td>
